<h2>Verify Your Email Address</h2>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>To finalize your user activation on the <strong>{{appName}}</strong> portal, please confirm your email address by clicking the button below:</p>
<div align="center">
  <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" class="btn">Verify Email Address</a>
</div>
<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link in your browser:</p>
<p style="font-size: 13px; word-break: break-all;"><a href="{{verificationUrl}}">{{verificationUrl}}</a></p>
<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">This verification link will expire in 24 hours.</p>
